window.products.push({"id":594116,"name":"BEW Small Wall Clock, 8 Inch Retro Decorative Wooden Wall Clock, Silent Non-Ticking Analog Round Hanging Clock for Kitchen, Living Room, Bedroom, Natu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABLJA2twL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nostalgic and Cozy Style: Add a touch of nostalgia and warmth to your home with BEW wooden wall clock. The vintage design and wooden construction can create a cozy and welcoming atmosphere in any room, especially those with a rustic or vintage decor style. Eye-Catching Design: Our kitchen wall clock is also an eye-catching design element in your kitchen, adding visual interest and drawing attention to the space. The retro design sets it apart from other kitchen decor items and can serve as a focal point in the room. Noiseless and Accurate Timekeeping: Enjoy a peaceful environment in your bedroom or office with our whisper-quiet wall clock. The high-quality sweep movements ensure there is no ticking sound, and the quartz movement ensures accurate timekeeping to help you stay on schedule. Wall Decor: Our 8 inch retro wall clock can also serve as a decorative wall piece in your living room or bedroom, adding texture and visual interest to your walls. It works well in rooms with a vintage or rustic decor, but can also add a touch of warmth and personality to more modern or minimalist room designs. Practical and Compact: Our small kitchen clock has practical value, allowing you to keep track of time while cooking, baking, or completing other kitchen tasks. The clock's compact 8 inch size makes it a great choice for smaller kitchens or spaces where you don't want a larger clock taking up too much room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ABLJA2twL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEW","source_asin":"B0BSDKWDKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSDKWDKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSDKWDKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594117,"name":"Home Decorators Collection Cayden Wall Clock, 36\" DIAMETERx3 D, Antique Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SOJ1MR8HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Like many round wall clocks, the Cayden Wall Clock starts out at its center with a white antiqued paper face and Roman numerals. However, there ends the similarity of this decorative wall clock with any other you may have seen. This transitional piece opens out to a partitioned frame made up of mercury glass-style mirror panels punctuated by faux leather and studded embellishments. The transitional appeal of this large wall clock transcends design movements and artistic styles, resulting in a timepiece with enduring decor relevance. White antiqued paper face. Roman numerals. Hour and minute hands. Glass lens. Takes one AA battery, not included. Includes D-ring hanger. Actual size is 36\"DIAMETERx3\"D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SOJ1MR8HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Decorators Collection","source_asin":"B00S6NYAN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S6NYAN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S6NYAN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
