window.products.push({"id":594227,"name":"GREECHO Portable Blender, One-handed Drinking Mini Blender for Shakes and Smoothies, 12 oz Personal Blender with Rechargeable USB, Made with BPA-Free ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDzaXqfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍓UNIQUE ONE-HANDED DRINKING SMOOTHIE BLENDER 🍓 Thanks to its genius industrial design, our GREECHO small blender is the world’s first one-handed drinking blender for shakes and smoothies. This mini blender works hard so you don't have to — just snap the seal lip open and closed so it's sealed shut (and leak-proof!) when you're done sipping. 💌ULTRA SMART SAFETY PROTECTION 💌 Our confidence in safety comes from the dual protection system and material. GREECHO single serve blender is featuring intelligent, power-off protection, overload protection. In addition, it made with food-grade non-toxic, and eco-friendly Tritan material, as well as totally BPA free, you’ll fall in love with this powerhouse. 🚁BLENDING WHEREVER AND WHENEVER 🚁 This portable blender with rechargeable USB goes beyond just smoothies and shakes: It can grate cheese, mince garlic, and even make frozen cocktails thanks to its high-speed mixer system. Charge using a laptop, with a power bank, a USB charger, or even in the car. 🏡EASE OF USE AND MAINTENANCE 🏡 GREECHO smoothie blender has a 20% larger caliber, making it easier to feed ingredients. All you have to do to operate this milkshake maker is double press the start button. As for keeping this device clean? Due to the mini blender adopts one-piece molding technology, just put some water in the small blender and double press for automatic cleaning. 🍓WHAT YOU GET🍓 GREECHO 12 oz. portable blender, Micro USB cable, user manual, quick-start guide, our worry-free lifetime warranty, and prompt friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDzaXqfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREECHO","source_asin":"B09K3SGZK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K3SGZK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K3SGZK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
