window.products.push({"id":594235,"name":"Mr and Mrs Gnomes Plush Set of 2, Christmas Gnome Plush, Christmas Gnome Ornaments Handmade Swedish Tomte Elf Decorations, Plush Swedish Tomte Gnome S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pRlv6uVIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES: 2 CHRISTMAS GNOME PLUSH; SPECIFICATION: 11.4\" in height, 5.5\" in width. Swedish Gnomes Set - Gnomes, also known as a Tomte or Nisse, originate from Scandinavian area, full of nordic elements. In folklore, Gnome guards our homes, and protects us from evil and misfortune. The elf gnome plush will bring us good luck, happiness and warmth, and it also adds a little magical to our houses. NICE IN MATERIAL & FINE IN CRAFTMANSHIP: Gnomes are mythological creatures from Scandinavian folklore. Today they are typically associated with winter solstice and the Christmas season. The Christmas Holiday Gnomes are designed by professional artisans, featuring a heavy base to enhance its stability, not easy to tip over. Made of sleek plush and premium felt, these Tomte gnomes are environment-friendly and comfortable to touch. Adorable in Design & FUNNY TO WATCH: Long hair, plush beard and funny large noses make the Swedish Tomte dolls look clumzy but very lovely. The dolls wear tall traditional hats, which protect their ears safe from the freezing cold. Their fiber fur long white hair, beard and bulbous nose are well-known traits of these cute cunning gnomes. Bendable wire in their ridiculously tall hat make them more lovely & funny with adorable te whimsy. PERFECT AS DECOR & IDEAL AS GIFTS: The Mr and Mrs gnomes plush set will bring a lot of joy as Christmas decoration. They are perfect on your desk to bring a bit of whimsical cheer to your home or office. Each Gnome plush is absolutely charming and will win over Gnome lovers' heart. The clumsy but funny cute look makes them wonderful as gifts to your girl friend on Christmas or other festive theme parties. RICH IN MEANINGS & VERSATILE IN USAGE: The adorable tomte gnome is perfect for spreading holiday spirit and good luck to your whole family. They are perfect as holiday decoration, to be placed on backyard, kitchen table, fireplace or Christmas trees. Also wonderful as gifts to your curious lovely kids, on Thanksgiving and Christmas, to tell them fairy tales.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pRlv6uVIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"masteymoh","source_asin":"B0BNNBJR4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNBJR4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNBJR4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594236,"name":"GMISUN Spice Jars with Bamboo Lids, 4oz Glass Spice Bottles, 4Pcs Empty Round Spice Containers with Wood Airtight Lids, Farmhouse Minimalist Food Jars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlPvIYgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GLASS SPICE JARS WITH BAMBOO LIDS: Taking inspiration from natural and minimalist design, GMISUN spice jars combine bamboo and glass to create a modern yet rustic look instead of regular shaker spice bottles, perfect for different styles of decor such as farmhouse, stylish, minimalist. Made of high-quality and lead-free glass, to ensure durability and safety. Clear glass containers allow us to differentiate what’s inside, so lower the risk of picking up the wrong spices. AIRTIGHT SPICE JARS WITH WIDE MOUTH: Natural bamboo with food-grade silicone-sealed rings creates an airtight seal to keep our spices as fresh as possible for long-time storage. Plus, the wood lids have good suction to the jars, the airtight lids secure the jars for spices tightly, keeping air and ants out. COMPLETE SPICE CONTAINERS SET FOR MULTI-PURPOSE: This spice canister set of 4 small spice jars is perfect for tackling major pantry organization projects. It was also designed to be multipurpose because it is not only limited to filling spices/herbs but for some variety of crafts just like candle-making and wedding/party favors, great gift for someone who likes organization, even use as decors to showcase your collection at the workplace. CAREFULLY PACKED & IDEAL GIFT: GMISUN puts a soft layer on the top and bottom of the box to protect the empty spice containers, cardboard between individual jars to prevent scratching in a sturdy box. We added more packaging materials to reduce the damage of seasoning containers set. If there is any damage to the glass spice bottles you receive or other issues, please contact us, we will solve the issues for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mlPvIYgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B0BSLBZS73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSLBZS73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSLBZS73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594237,"name":"Premium Vials - 12 Pcs, White Double Wall Plastic Jars with Dome Lid (2 OZ, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21x3PYp5wPL.jpg","description":"High quality cosmetic style 12 pcs Double Sided Plastic Jars and comes with dome shape lid. Double Wall Jars have 2 walls: High Gloss finish PS (polystyrene) outer wall for increased durability and PP (polypropylene) inner wall to preserve moisture. Great for cosmetics, lotions, creams, handmade lotions and for your business needs.   1 oz jar dimensions: Diameter 2.169 in / 5.509 cm Height 1.59 in / 4.039 cm  2 oz jar dimensions: Diameter 2.337 in / 5.936 cm Height 1.929 in / 4.900 cm  4 oz jar dimensions: Diameter 2.885 in / 7.328 cm Height 2.414 in / 6.132 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21x3PYp5wPL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Vials","source_asin":"B071HTL5MP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HTL5MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HTL5MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
