window.products.push({"id":594239,"name":"Howard Elliott 92117 Aubrey Mirror, Diamond","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ibSTV+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Aubrey mirror features a rustic, weathered Taupe finish. The square frame is accented with grooves in a quatrefoil shape. The mirror on this piece is not beveled. Its shabby chic style makes this mirror a favorite for bringing some classic style to your decor. This simple yet stunning piece would be a great addition to any room. It is a perfect focal point for an entryway, bathroom, bedroom or any room in your home. D-rings are affixed to the back of the mirror so it is ready to hang right out of the box in either a horizontal or vertical orientation! also available in an elongated quatrefoil shape. Dimensions: 36 inch by 36 inch by 3 inch; inner dimensions: 27 inch by 27 inch. Note: do not hang by picture wire or chain, hang by the two d-hooks directly onto adequate hooks securely fixed to the wall. Howard Elliott has been redefining the home furnishing and hospitality industry with innovative designs of decorative mirrors, accessories, and occasional furniture since 2001. Lifestyles change the way we live and Howard Elliott mission is to create exceptional products which truly finish a room. Howard Elliott distinguishes itself from our competitors with the effortless adaptability of our product line. Versatility, style and customization are just a few of the features built into every item we produce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617ibSTV+pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Elliot","source_asin":"B077THJS42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077THJS42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077THJS42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
