window.products.push({"id":594249,"name":"Ex-Cell Charlton DIATOMITE SOAP Dish, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pyDdI8vxL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Charlton Soap Tray by EXCELL is made of Diatomite, an eco-friendly and naturally sourced material. This unique soap holder tray from EXCELL is a highly functional bathroom accessory that dries quickly and is anti-microbial. A perfect sink-side companion for your soaps, sponges, and lotions, the soap dish can also be used as a drink coaster or a storage tray. Maximize the life of your soap with this instant-drying Diatomite soap holder from EXCELL. Care Instructions: Simply wash it with water and let It air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pyDdI8vxL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXCELL","source_asin":"B0881YBWTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0881YBWTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0881YBWTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594250,"name":"Italian Dinnerware - Circle Round Platter - Handmade in Italy from our POP Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513xpqnCsUL._AC_.jpg","description":"ONE-OF-A-KIND ITALIAN DINNERWARE COLLECTION: Our POP Collection is a wide array of dinnerware items that are inspired by bright colors weaved into circles, stripes, checks & triangles. Our beautiful triangle themed water pitcher is handmade and hand painted by Italian artisans and make the perfect addition to any dinnerware set. This one-of-a-kind art piece will add a colorful touch your home & kitchen decor. ROUND CERAMIC SERVING PLATE: Our breathtaking collection features a stunning, yet minimalistic circle design that is 12.5'' in size. This functional art serving plate is hand painted with bright, in your face circles. This Italian art dinnerware collection makes an exquisite European style decor at home. This dining room décor and place settings look beautiful mixed and matched. HANDMADE BY ITALIAN ARTISTS: Each of our hand painted ceramics is hand crafted by our skilled artisans in Italy. The Modigliani POP Collection, inspired by Pop Art, arrives with cheerful disruptiveness, coloring homes and tables to make everyday a celebration! Please note, each piece is hand made, hand painted and may not be an exact replica of the product pictured. GET THE COMPLETE SET: The years of dusting off your fine China are over! This is a set you’ll be proud to use year round and host people over with. This POP collection is sold separately and features: Serving Platter, Dinner Plate, Small & Large Casserole Dish, Butter Dish & Large Twisted Vase, Salad Plates & Serving Set, Rice Spoon, Pasta Server, Coffee Cups & Saucer, & Soup Bowls. SUPPORT TRADITION: Modigliani Italian dinnerware strongly supports the tradition of passing down art from past four generation. All set pieces in this authentic dinnerware collection were made by Italian artists that have learned classic ways of creating beautiful, functional art. Collect a piece of Italy and indulge your eyes with a natural dinnerware set that is made to last and support the timeless tradition of handmade ceramics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513xpqnCsUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMBRACE LA GRANDE VITA","source_asin":"B00Y9GW11M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y9GW11M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y9GW11M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594251,"name":"Tache 3 Piece Cotton Modern Summer Storm Reversible Bedspread Quilt Set, Cal King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dWBhZl24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Soothing and simply colored bedspread is a great addition to any room, small whirlpools decorate this amazing bedspread. Elegantly texturized This Bedspread is Unbelievably Soft and Warm, And weighs less than most other quilt sets. Resilient Material withstands Pilling even after washing. It's light weight makes it a very convenient and affordable alternative to more heavy quilts and comforters sets. Great for the Elderly, People with joint Problems, or even young children. Buy One Today! Use as a Thin Spring and Summer Quilt or as Decorative, Elaborate Bedspread","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dWBhZl24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tache Home Fashion","source_asin":"B0BFKFM89L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFKFM89L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFKFM89L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594252,"name":"AdirHome Bamboo Wine Rack - Easy to Assemble 18 Stackable Bottle Storage Shelves Stand Display for Bar, Tabletop, Kitchen Counter, Natural Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bXw63HqQL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect solution to wine storage that grows with your collection, the AdirHome 18-Bottle Bamboo Wine Rack allows you to proudly display up to 18 bottles of your favorite vintages anywhere in the home. Place it on top of a refrigerator or kitchen cabinet away from foot traffic, on shelves and credenzas in family rooms and dens, in repurposed old breakfronts and other quaint furniture, or boldly out in the open for friends to see. Thick and sturdy to provide long-lasting use, this wine rack is crafted out of beautifully finished, laminated bamboo that contains no chemicals or formaldehyde. This food-safe, sustainable material is resistant to moisture and bacterial growth, more resistant to damage than traditional hardwoods to hold up against everyday wear and tear. Wine enthusiasts know that properly positioning wine bottles during storage is a key element to maintaining quality. AdirHome's stackable wine racks do just that, furnished with a slight downward slope of 750-ml bottles that keeps corks from drying out during storage and prevents wine from spoiling . Use these attractive racks side by side , individually in different rooms, or stack the 9-bottle units on top of each other to save valuable counter space . The well-machined, pre-finished components assemble tool-free in a jiffy by simply placing each wave bar into the slots on the bamboo blocks to securely interlock them together. AdirHome's bamboo stackable wine racks make great gifts for birthdays, holidays, bridal showers, weddings and housewarmings. With it s easy-to-incorporate, natural finish and visually pleasing, wavy design , this wine rack is a stylish, fun way to house any wine collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bXw63HqQL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AdirHome","source_asin":"B07GBG87BB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GBG87BB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GBG87BB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
