window.products.push({"id":594267,"name":"Round Chafing Dish Stainless Steel Chafing Dish Buffet Chafer 3L Catering Chafers and Buffet Warmers with Fuel Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r2rZ+bCXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Do you want to enjoy a variety of hot meals when you are camping? Then you can't go wrong with our practical and attractive chafing dish. With its good thermal insulation and thermal conductivity, it locks in nutrients and keeps food in its original taste, making it ideal for family trips or commercial use. Details Practical Lid: It is equipped with a lid that fits the pot to ensure good heat retention and also protects it from dust. Its clear glass section makes it easy to see the food served inside for easy selection by guests. The top has an anti-scalding handle for easy access.Ventilation Holes: The lid has ventilation holes to prevent excessive airflow inside the pan from causing injury. The venting holes are designed for safety and to make food taste better! Support Feet: The base is equipped with three reinforced support feet, which make it more stable and less likely to tip over. The smooth surface prevents the table from being scratched. Application It can be used in hotels, buffets, restaurants, family gatherings, dormitories, banquets, weddings, outdoors and on other occasions to serve a variety of dishes. Specification Material: Stainless Steel, Glass, Zinc AlloyColor: Silver, GoldFinish: ElectroplateChafer Inner Diameter: 28 cm/11inProduct Total Diameter: 38 cm/14.96inProduct Total Height: 23 cm/9.05inChafing Fuel Frame Height: 5.5 cm/2.16inNet Weight: 1.5kg/3.3lbsCapacity: 3L/3.17Qt Package Included 1* Chafing Dish1* Lid1* Chafing Fuel Frame1* Fuel Holder Notes 1.Please do not touch the surface of the dish when it is heating to avoid burns.2.Please allow the slight color difference caused by the shooting light and 1-3 cm error due to manual measurement, and make sure you do not mind before ordering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r2rZ+bCXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BhshuidlS","source_asin":"B0BGHNYDRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGHNYDRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGHNYDRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
