window.products.push({"id":594385,"name":"Cooling Pillow Cases 2 Pack, Q-Max 0.4 Cooling Pillowcases for Hot Sleepers, Cool Summer Pillow Cover with Double-Side Design & Hidden Zipper (Gray, 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810TIjG6JHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Double-Sided Design】 Featured with a double-sided design, our 2-pack cooling pillowcases are perfect for all seasons. One side is made with Japanese Arc-Chill Cooling Fibers(Q-Max>0.4 ), cool & silky—perfect for summer, especially idea for people who suffer from night sweats. While the other side is made of 100% cotton fabric, breathable & comfortable—perfect for spring, autumn and winter, help you sleep better every night. ❄️【Skin & Hair Friendly】 Are you tired of waking up in the morning with a frizzy birds nest on your head? Our soft & silky cooling pillowcase set features anti-static, minimizes hair knotting, roughness and dryness, it can also help to reduce facial wrinkles and protects skin moisture. Say goodbye to bad hair and skin days and hello to luxurious cool nights. ❄️【Hidden Zipper Design】 Our summer pillow covers with hidden zipper closure, not only make it look more dedicate, but also easy to remove and fit different size pillows closely. Your pillow will never slip out like the envelope closure pillowcases. In addition, it avoids accidentally facial hurt by zipper contact. ❄️【Easy Care & Cleaning】 The cool pillow cases are a better way to keep cool in the summer, easier to replace or clean. They are suitable for both hand wash & machine washable. And we recommend you to wash them inside a mesh laundry bag, in order to prevent entanglement during washing. ❄️【What You Get】Comes with 2 pack of cooling pillowcases. They’re suitable for pillows with different sizes and shapes, which includes queen 20x30”, standard 20x26” or other shapes. What’s more, you can choose the favorite ones from 3 different colors (grey, pink, green) to meet your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810TIjG6JHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PY HOME & SPORTS","source_asin":"B089CLHS16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CLHS16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CLHS16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
