window.products.push({"id":594388,"name":"Silver Buffalo Stainless Steel drinkware-Cups, 20 Ounces, Water Bottle - Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SgxabpTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Silver Buffalo Double Wall 18/8 Stainless Steel Lined Water Bottle lets you enjoy 20 ounces of your favorite beverage on the go with this cool, convenient, and durable double-wall vacuum insulated tumbler. Perfect for hot beverages up to 8 hours and cold beverages for up to 24 hours, this tumbler allows you to hydrate in style while on the go or at home! This tumbler is made of 18/8 stainless steel and a shatterproof plastic lid. That means the tumbler and lid are both impact-resistant, durable, rust-proof, and shatterproof. All components are BPA-free. Do not use in the microwave; top-rack dishwasher safe! Impress your friends and stay cool or hot with this impressive Silver Buffalo Stainless Water Bottle. The plastic screw-on flip-top lid helps keep liquids in the bottle to eliminate spills and messes while the durable stainless steel construction features break-resistant qualities. Built to last, this metal water bottle is perfect for adults and kids alike. Have confidence knowing you are purchasing an officially licensed Double Wall Stainless Water Bottle from Silver Buffalo. This reusable water bottle makes a great gift for all the Silver Buffalo fans in your life; whether it's for girls, boys, kids, or adults, they will feel like they are hanging ten while keeping hydrated. Working in collaboration with licensors and brands, Silver Buffalo develops unique, creative, and ground-breaking products with a devotion to detail and innovation, while staying true to current trends. Silver Buffalo prides themselves on manufacturing and distributing exciting products that connect with the child or fan(atic) in all of us. We focus on the design, manufacture, and distribution of items featuring popular cultural icons. Silver Buffalo features all of your favorite comic heroes, cartoon characters, board games, movies, and more. #TAGS: Water, Housewarming, Gifting, Birthday, Kitchen, Home, Celebration, Accessories, Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Water Bottle, Tumbler, Cup, Stainless, Travel, Insulated, Beverage, Insulated Tumbler, BPA-free, botas de agua para niños, 20oz, Double Wall, Drink, travel mug, vacuum sealed, gym, sports, exercise, hydration, protek, 600ml, jug, wide mouth, purple, steel, lid, agua, 18/8 Steel Lined","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SgxabpTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silver Buffalo","source_asin":"B0C1J5X512","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1J5X512","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1J5X512","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
