window.products.push({"id":594561,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine Kit Food Saver Automatic Packing Machine 2020 Upgrade 60Kpa Strong Vacuum |Dry Moist Food Modes | UL Safe | Widened Sealing Tape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612XJ1A2fOL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"[Strong compression] OCOOKO upgraded vacuum sealing machine has a powerful vacuum capacity of -60Kpa, and completes the vacuum and sealing within 10-20 seconds (use time depends on the size of the bag). You can choose dry and wet food sealing modes. The meat products, vegetables and fruits can be kept fresh for a long time after being compressed into a vacuum. [Multi-function and easy operation] If you do not want to vacuum but only want to seal, please click the \"seal\" button here, you can only seal. It is recommended to use this function when storing food normally. There is a Cutter on the top of the product to cut the roll bag. You can determine the length of the roll before placing the food, and then use this Cutter to quickly cut the roll bag. No need to cut the roll with another knife. [Applicable to both vacuum bags and Seal containers] The package contains a 5m vacuum Roll bag. Uarter's vacuum bags have been enhanced in quality, have a longer service life and are not easily damaged. Can be used multiple times. In addition, this product can also vacuum airtight tanks, wine bottles and other vacuum equipment, which can be easily achieved by only using our attached connecting hose. [Safe use] This product has passed the ETL test and has NTC's intelligent temperature protection function. If the temperature of the sealed heater is too high, the product will automatically enter the protection mode. When the button is pressed, the indicator light flashes and there is no response. When the temperature returns to normal, the indicator light will stop flashing, and the product will automatically operate normally. Please rest assured. [1 year manufacturer's warranty] Before use, put the food bag into the sealing groove before starting. For detailed instructions, please watch the page video and instructions. All OCOOKO products have a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. It also comes with an instruction manual, so please read it carefully before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612XJ1A2fOL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCOOKO","source_asin":"B089YN2Y8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089YN2Y8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089YN2Y8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
