window.products.push({"id":594629,"name":"Material Girl Mermaid Ombre Twin 5 Piece Bed in a Bag (BIB3819TW-3200)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XG3Txh0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Material Girl brand is the perfect blend of fashion, quality and value. The brand is created and inspired by the ultimate girl power icon, Madonna and her daughter, Lola. These comforters, sheet, and throw blankets are designed for the young woman who appreciates being an individual and loves to take risks with her fashion choices. Prints, colors, and textures mix and blend to create a one of a kind looks that the brave and bold bring into every room. Material Girls offers fun, fashionable products that inspire girls to go after their dreams and never give up. The Material Girl Home Collection allows everyone who dares to create a world of entertainment and fearlessness inside the home. Dream and live passionately with Material Girl home decor and bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XG3Txh0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Material Girl","source_asin":"B09KGZ9NTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KGZ9NTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KGZ9NTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594630,"name":"Lodge Stoneware Baking Dish, 9\" x 13\", Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zwg5BJeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Molded out of natural clay, these elegant pieces are fired at high temperatures and then glazed with vibrant colors for a lifetime of better baking and stylish serving. This 9 x 13 inch rectangle dish is ideal for everything from standout side dishes to eye-catching entrees to delightful desserts. Use to bake, serve, store and reheat meals. Oven safe up to 450-degrees F. Dishwasher and microwave safe. Do not use on stovetop. Why Stoneware? Our stoneware collection is great for baking desserts, sides, casseroles and main courses. We have selected colors that are an extension of our best-selling enamel colors to beautifully round out consumers' cookware collections. Stoneware is very convenient for when you want to bake family dishes like lasagna (more acidic) or need more gentle heat / less of a crust. It also gives consumers the ability to freeze and reheat the dish - even in a microwave. Stoneware provides very even heat distribution and is great for the avid baker. Why would consumers choose Lodge Stoneware? Lodge stoneware is twice-fired for durability with a glazed finish that resist stains. Each piece was custom designed by Lodge based on learnings from thorough testing in Lodge's test kitchen. We selected dish dimensions that are most commonly used in recipes and designed each piece with plenty of depth - so that you never feel the dish is too shallow. Handles are arced for easy lifting in /out of oven. The stoneware's glazed finish is easy to clean. What is the max temperature? Any other cooking notes? Oven-safe to up to 450 Degree. Dishwasher, refrigerator, freezer and microwave safe. Not recommended for stovetop or broiler use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zwg5BJeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B01MSNBDFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSNBDFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSNBDFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
