window.products.push({"id":594632,"name":"48 inch Round Ruffled Tobacco Cloth & Burlap Rustic Farmhouse Simple Christmas Tree Skirt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oWFomk+YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This beautiful combination of rustic burlap and soft natural color tobacco cloth will compliment many different styles of Christmas decor. The skirt is very well made and is fully lined with a tea dye color cotton fabric on the back side. Three ties on the back side will keep the skirt in place. There are seven rows of burlap ruffles and six rows of soft natural color tobacco cloth. All edges are seamed and sealed so you will not have any unsightly fraying of the burlap. This primitive burlap tree skirt will surely be a favorite family decoration for years to come. Limited quantity available. 100% jute burlap, 100% cotton tobacco cloth and 100% cotton lining. Spot clean by hand. Do not machine wash. Made in India exclusively for Jubilee Creative Studio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oWFomk+YL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JCS","source_asin":"B07KJ9Q5P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KJ9Q5P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KJ9Q5P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594633,"name":"Bulova Miniature Clock Train","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JXUAAx-DL._AC_SL1419_.jpg","description":"The Bulova Story In 1875, a young Czech immigrant named Joseph Bulova set up shop in New York City, and a legendary American watch brand was born. Bulova was trained as a jeweler, and his expertise carried over into his watchmaking career, which began around 1911 with boudoir clocks and pocket watches, and soon evolved to include what was then one of the latest and most fashionable technological innovations: the wristwatch. Bulova introduced its first line of wristwatches in 1919. The company grew and prospered, and soon early radio and television ads were declaring, \"America runs on Bulova time.\" In the 1950s, continuing its legacy of innovation, Bulova introduced Accutron, the first electronic watch, and the first breakthrough in timekeeping technology in over 300 years. The Accutron timing mechanism was later adapted for use by NASA computers and a Bulova timer was even placed on the moon to control transmissions of data. Bulova timepieces have kept official time aboard Air Force One and have also served as official timepieces for U.S. Olympic teams. Today, Bulova maintains its tradition of excellence in technology and design, offering a diverse collection of beautiful precision timepieces for every occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JXUAAx-DL._AC_SL1419_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bulova","source_asin":"B0027CTABE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027CTABE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0027CTABE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
