window.products.push({"id":594657,"name":"PreserveNext Reusable Organic Produce/Multi-purpose Cotton Bags - For Storing Spices, Vegetables, – 6 Pack (2 each of S, M, L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNNf0x45L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Mission PreserveNext believes in living life in a way that is friendly to the natural environment and is sustainable for the earth. We are doing our bit by designing eco-friendly, bio-degradable reusable totes to cut down on wasteful one-time-use of paper/plastic bags. Product Specifications - Organic 6oz 100% Natural Cotton- Available in 3 Sizes - Small (8” x 10”), Medium (10” x 12”), Large (12” x 15”)” Construction 1) Stitching: Interlocking stitching across the bag for sturdiness and longevity 2) Drawstring: Double sided thick flat drawstring for easy opening and closing 3) Checkout Credit Made Easy: Tare weight shown on exterior label Nature of Cotton 1) Breathe Easy: Cotton allows for good air circulation and keeps fruits, vegetables and garden produce fresh and dry unlike plastic bags which can cause a slimy mess overtime 2) Go Green: All natural, reusable, chemical free & 100% bio-degradable ‘produce organizer set’ Multi-Functional - These bags can be customized and embroidered to make wonderful gifts for friends and family- Great accomplice for trips to a farmers market or supermarket - Perfect for stashing dry spices, lentils, accessories, crafts, toys, soaps, cosmetics, candles, shoes etc.- Great for birthday party favors, wedding gifts, and baby showers gifts etc. Fabric Care Cold Machine Wash and Flat or Line dry thereafter Please expect 7-10% shrinkage after 1st wash. If bag appears wrinkled after wash pull out fabric while wet; then fold flat and air dry. Over time and with use bags will break-in and soften. Warranty All PreserveNext Grocery Bags are backed by 1 year limited warranty. Please contact us via email if you have any questions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNNf0x45L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PreserveNext","source_asin":"B071DV5DDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071DV5DDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071DV5DDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
