window.products.push({"id":594713,"name":"Smiles by Julie Sisters Quotations In A Jar. A Month of Loving, Amusing and Humorous Quotes. Show how much you love & value her Friendship. Unique Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GTHeXt3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE GIFT FOR YOUR SISTER: Have you been looking for teen girl trendy stuff trying to find ideal gifts for your sister? Well, let us introduce you to our beautiful jar of inspirational quotes, filled with multiple reasons why your older or younger sister is also your best friend & your partner in crime, & who deserves all your love & gratitude! WHY CHOOSE OUR INSPIRATION JAR: Inspirational & kind notes are a powerful reminder to your sister that she has always been by your side through both difficult & thrilling times! Each message can be the right spark to lift up their mood, recall a positive memory & express kindness & caring. VERSATILE, ORNAMENTAL & BEAUTIFUL: Every jar is filled with over 30 kind & creative quotes that will make anyone who reads them feel happy, positive & valued. Celebrate Christmas, Birthdays, Valentines Day, Mothers Day, Best Wishes, Thanksgiving & Congratulations for any occasion with our jar of inspirational quotes. START OR FINISH THE DAY WITH A SMILE: Begin or end the day by picking a note from our happy jar and focusing on the materialised message that can help ground us during our busy days. Our positive thoughts jar is the perfect gift for inspiring & helping one reflect on their lives & reach for their goals. OUR SMILES BY JULIE STORY: Each jar of smiles from our brand range comes within a beautiful & colourful gift box. We have an inspirational jar for various themes like Quotes for Mom, Mindfulness, Love & Friendship & more! All materials used are recyclable & the glass jar & lid itself can be repurposed in many ways to help reduce the impact on our planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GTHeXt3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smiles by Julie","source_asin":"B01ICUKCUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ICUKCUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ICUKCUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":594714,"name":"Paderno World Cuisine 13 by 10.625 Inch Black Oval Dutch Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUc-hM8rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Paderno World Cuisine 13 by 10.625 inch black oval Dutch oven is primarily used to slowly braise or simmer. The ability of the Dutch oven to evenly distribute heat makes it perfect for tenderizing any cut of meat for stews or heavy cassoulets. These ovens are easy to clean, durable and compatible with standard stovetops, induction ranges, and conventional ovens. Each oven comes with a matching lid to keep in heat and moisture. The “Chasseur” cookware line has been enameled twice. It is first enameled in black, which seals the edges, protects against corrosion and is a primer for the color. Next it is enameled with a color, which adds durability and ensures that the oven retains its color. The enamel makes the oven easy to clean. All lid knobs are heat resistant up to 400° F. Note that all dimensions are interior and do not include handles or thickness of material.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FUc-hM8rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chasseur","source_asin":"B000ENERWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ENERWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ENERWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
