window.products.push({"id":594862,"name":"PD Plush Decor Batik Cream-Base Tapestries Black & White Mandala Elephant Hippy Tapestry Indian Traditional Hippie Beach Throw Wall Art Bohemian Wall ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612LOydmOCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add a rich yet pleasing and an ethnic feel to ceiling or wall of your room, dining / drawing hall with this Black and White Tapestries Elephant Mandala Hippie Tapestry Indian Traditional Throw Beach Throw Wall Art College Dorm Bohemian Wall Hanging Boho Queen Bedspread cotton handmade wall hanging.  Color: *****  As shown with Black and white tones  Speciality and Uniqueness:  ***********************  Only available with Plush Decor  Go for a dramatic makeover of your wall and this tapestry would become a conversational piece of art. A must have in any season for all traditional savvy's. This is a rare beauty not to be missed, a genuine collector's item & the result of masterly workmanship. Each tapestry has got its unique imperfections.This is what is marked or called as registration error by the printers and experienced artisans, and are intentionally included on the screen print to simulate traditional prints and natural look. These elegant design tapestries are hand or screen printed on 100% cotton, in spacious but child free and smoke free factories.  ITEM SPECIFICATIONS: ********************  Fabric : 100 % Cotton  Origin : Rajasthan (India)  Brand : Handmade  Bed Size : Queen (Double) 215 x 235 cms. approx.  Pattern : Elephant Mandala, Indian tradition, Elephant  Fabric: Screen Printed Design.  Usage: Almost any for Home Decor Purpose like- Tapestry, Wall Hanging, Bedspread, Wall Decor, Room Divider, Curtain, Table Cloth, College Dorm, Picnic and Beach throw.  Washing Instructions: Do not use chlorine, bleach or any detergent. Wash separately in cold water. Do not tumble dry. Avoid direct sunlight.  Due to design and process being intricate and handmade, colors may spill or spread over other areas. Items may have stains of colors. Slight weaving effect and loose threads may appear. Stitches may be loose Colors may gets misprinted or OFF the part on some areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612LOydmOCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PD Plush Decor","source_asin":"B01016IY2I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-594862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01016IY2I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01016IY2I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
